\f0\fs24 \cf0 User Stories\
\
As a manager I want to view employees in my department so I can see who to manage.\
\
As a manager I want to see who is working in shifts so I can communicate accordingly.\
\
As an employee I want to modify my profile in the event of special circumstances.\
\
As an employee I want to see information about a product so I can see details and images.\
\
As an employee I want to be able to search for a product I need so I can access it quickly without searching a list.\
\
\
Criteria\
\
Manager can view employees in specific listed departments, can also see employees and specific employee information\
\
Manager can see shifts with employees listed in each shift, each shift is sorted\
\
The employee can change their name and it saves\
\
Employee can view product info with information and nullable info like pictures\
\
When the employee searches for something the search brings up associated items based on what is typed in the search bar}